Simple RC circuit
**********************************************************************
* this test establishes that using "FREQ" in an ABM (ish) expression 
* works correctly
**********************************************************************
Isrc 1 0 AC 1 0 sin(0 1 1e+5 0 0)
R1 1 0 {hertz}
C1 1 0 2e-6


.AC DEC 1 1 1e5 
.print AC format=csv file=output.csv precision=17 VR(1) VI(1)
.END
